# Checked out with LF on every platform, also where core.autocrlf=true (Git for Windows): the
# hook and scaffold scripts sh runs, the Python scripts and tests, the texts the tests read
# byte for byte (docs/LIVING_PLAN.md) or count (the skills' size ceilings), and the dotfiles
# (the .gitignore files, which a Windows checkout had turned CRLF, and this file).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
